<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1b1b1b;">
<p>Dear {!Contact.FirstName},</p>
<p>Please find attached our proposal for <strong>{!Quote.Name}</strong>.</p>
<table style="border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;">
<tr><td style="padding: 2px 16px 2px 0;">Grand total</td><td style="padding: 2px 0;"><strong>{!Quote.TotalPrice}</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding: 2px 16px 2px 0;">Valid until</td><td style="padding: 2px 0;"><strong>{!Quote.ExpirationDate}</strong></td></tr>
</table>
<p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email.</p>
<p>Kind regards,<br/>
{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}<br/>
Servomex</p>
</body>
</html>
